            "review_title": "Review at Guangdong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Meow N\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nBest Cantonese roast duck in Nha Trang\nSep 2026 • Family\nWe held my son’s birthday party here and had a wonderful experience. The location is very convenient, very close to our house. The food was delicious and the service was very fast. Special thanks to Ms. Linh, one of the staff members, who was extremely kind and helpful.\nInsider tip:\nYou should definitely try the pizza, haha, especially if you go with kids.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 25, 2026",
